  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building for Strengthening the Regulatory Framework for the Management of  Investment in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the capacity and effectiveness of research at MPI and improving the two-way link between MPI analytical work and decision making.  Strengthening the capacity of MPI in coordinating with other stakeholders in the formulation and implementation of policies and legal framework for state management of investment The ultimate objective of the grant is to help Ministry of Planning and Investment (MPI) create a business enabling environment and operate effectively its investment regulatory functions.  The objective will be achieved by enhancing the capacity and effectiveness of research at MPI and improving the two-way link between MPI analytical work and decision making. The grant will also strengthen the capacity of MPI in coordinating with other stakeholders in the formulation and implementation of policies and legal framework for state management of investment.</narrative>
  </description>
